WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.460
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.460
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.400
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.400
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.970
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.910
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.930
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.930
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.370
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.370
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.140
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.140
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.420
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.420
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.860
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.860
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:45.450
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:45.450
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.910
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.910
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.980
I can say love

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.710
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.710
It overflows with love.

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.710
will you love me?

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:57.320
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:57.320
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.270
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.270
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.830
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.830
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.480
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.480
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.370
It happened long, long ago.

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:32.810
Long before the time of my grandfather's grandfather.

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:35.450
Together with the power of the legendary Hero,

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:39.480
our god vanquished an evil that befell this village.

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:45.920
It tore the enemy to shreds - its strength was like that of a fierce deity!

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:46.930
I see...

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:50.030
Ever since then, it has been told that when this village is enveloped by evil,

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:57.500
a hero will appear and our god will revive following a burst of flames!

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:59.840
And this is it...?

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:03.240
It's just a fairy tale though.

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:04.540
Really?

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:08.750
Especially since this village isn't as old as he says.

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.150
Bad news!

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:13.650
Their weapons are waiting at the entrance...!

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:15.020
What?!

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:29.290
Parallel...!?

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:50.240
Thank you.

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:51.840
My pleasure...

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:56.070
This suits this work better.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.110
Thank you.

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:05.520
Just watching?

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:07.550
What else is there for me to do?

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:10.830
You have a point.

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:13.030
Hey, Kiriko!

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:15.330
That course data just now...

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:19.770
Here?

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:21.610
Something seems a bit off...

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:24.380
I can't really explain it, but I don't like it for some reason...

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:25.610
I'll check it.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:28.050
Amane-san's intuition certainly is amazing.

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:32.750
It's not as strong as Big Brother Seina's bad luck, but it's still mysterious.

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:36.660
Amane! Looks like you were right!

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:39.030
This one appears to have been doctored as well.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:42.020
I can extrapolate its course from its energy trail!

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:48.330
So this means Seina really is innocent!

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:52.510
Yes. The Kamidake's transport escort wasn't attacked at all.

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:56.140
It looks like they set everything up to conceal what they were really doing.

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:57.580
Why would they do that?!

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:01.380
Someone must want the Kamidake all for themselves...

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.620
You don't think it's that old hag, do you?!

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:05.580
It would be a high probability.

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:07.850
But look at this.

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:12.930
The transport ship headed straight into the GP and the Union's network.

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:17.000
If someone wanted to steal it, they would not want to pass through here.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.270
And then it suddenly vanished in the midst of it all...

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:21.530
It almost sounds like a Good Luck Ship.

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:25.870
But then that would make Big Brother Seina look even more guilty!

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:28.040
His bad luck can outdo even the Good Luck Ships...

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:30.640
It's no wonder they suspect him!

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:32.950
Hey! Isn't this area...

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:34.670
Yes, it is...

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:36.950
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:38.620
How did it turn out, Komachi-san?

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:43.990
Just as you said, pirates seem to be the real ones in charge of that area.

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:46.190
Pirates?!

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:47.660
Who?!

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:51.230
Sorry. That's all I know.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:54.570
Thank you! That information alone is more than enough!

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:57.840
Don't thank me. I owe the boy one.

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:59.600
I'm counting on you all.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:03.140
Looks like you found out where Seina-kun went.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:13.720
T-this can't be! I never expected that they would attack us here!

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:15.620
I'm scared...

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:21.920
They've located the cave Seina Yamada and the other villagers fled into!

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:27.070
Don't kill Seina Yamada. He's mine.

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:28.800
Tarant-sama.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.940
What should we do with this?

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:32.200
Dispose of it.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:39.770
Look out!

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.320
Are you all right?! Say something!

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.980
Mom!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.660
Damn them...!

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.560
Look!

00:06:12.110 --> 00:06:14.380
Our god has awoken!

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:17.650
You truly are the legendary hero!

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:18.750
Me...?!

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:22.620
Totally awesome! You really are the Hero!

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:25.460
Uh, I don't know about that...

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:27.260
The legend says this:

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:33.770
"The Hero will be offered to the god, and defeat the great evil they shall!"

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:35.200
Offered...?

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.040
Don't tell me you mean a human sacrifice?!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:39.210
- We're counting on you, Hero! - Please! Stop!

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:41.540
Good luck!

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:43.210
One...

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.110
Two...

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:47.200
Three!

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:58.220
They're like a bunch of rats that've scurried into their little hole.

00:06:58.220 --> 00:06:59.660
Come out, Seina Yamada!

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:01.790
We know you're in there!

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:04.060
Ow...!

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.400
Where am I...?

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:22.840
I'm supposed to sit here...?

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:32.660
Is this a robot?!

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:40.490
It's moving...

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:54.510
The god has revived!

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:58.540
Forward units! Commence raid!

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:26.370
W-what the...?!

00:08:46.070 --> 00:08:48.760
W-what're you doing?! Attack!

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:34.780
It's decided.

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:39.220
Ships are nice and all, but giant robots definitely suit guys the best...

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:44.460
Praise the Hero! Praise the god!

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:47.060
It was worth waiting all this time!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.090
Can I borrow this a little longer?

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:49.930
Huh?

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:51.130
I wanna rescue Fuku!

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:54.630
There's nothing to borrow! The Hero and our god share mind and body!

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:56.940
Do as you please!

00:09:56.940 --> 00:09:58.270
Thank you!

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.480
Where's their base?!

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:16.110
There?

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:22.630
Fuku!

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:35.240
Fuku!

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.440
Fuku!

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:43.880
Calm down!

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:46.780
Seina Yamada...!

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:01.260
Where's Fuku?! Tell me!

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:09.840
Seto-sama. A message from Mikami-sama.

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:12.410
Kiriko-sama and the other three have escaped from their house arrest

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:14.950
in the Kuramitsu family's second residence.

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:17.950
Apparently they exploited a weakness in the security system.

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:20.490
My, what shocking news.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:23.660
They took Kiriko-sama's Mizuki unit and escaped into space.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:25.990
They haven't been spotted since.

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:29.760
So do you think it's time?

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:31.660
Yes.

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:35.970
Well then, let's get going too.

00:11:35.970 --> 00:11:36.940
Yes, ma'am!

00:11:55.990 --> 00:11:57.350
Fuku!

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:01.290
I'll get you out of there right away!

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:08.570
Fuku!

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:13.240
I'm sorry I'm late!

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:14.610
Everything's OK now!

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:16.470
Let's go, it's dangerous here...

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:19.770
What's the matter?

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:31.660
T-these are...

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:39.970
How horrible!

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:42.000
Seina Yamada.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:46.070
Once again, you've infuriated me.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:49.740
This time you die for sure.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:52.180
Was it you?

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:55.480
Was it you who did terrible things to these little animals?!

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:56.920
What do they matter?

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.490
Compared to the humiliation you've given me,

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:01.720
they're just a bunch of useless little rabbits.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:06.320
How dare you...

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.420
Wanna fight, do you?

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.660
How I've been longing for this...

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:13.820
How dare you...

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:17.330
How dare you...!

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:55.740
OK! Keep it up!

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:58.040
No good! We can't hold on much longer!

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:10.280
The Kamidake!

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:44.760
I don't really know what's going on,

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:47.490
but I'm sensing amazing strength...

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:48.820
This is...

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:50.960
This is...!

00:14:59.970 --> 00:15:03.170
W-what're you doing?! Blast it to smithereens!

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:15.180
W-what the...?!

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:51.660
Impossible...!

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:54.490
The Kamidake didn't have the Mizuki unit in it!

00:15:54.490 --> 00:15:58.230
Tarant-sama. That thing hasn't been recorded in any known databank.

00:15:58.230 --> 00:16:00.260
We have to retreat!

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:04.560
Don't tell me what to do!

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:09.400
All ships into orbit! We'll finish this from space!

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:15.810
What's wrong, Mizuki-chan?

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:21.280
Seina...

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:24.510
Mikagami...?

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:26.720
It couldn't be...

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:41.540
What's going on, Tarant?

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:43.910
I haven't been informed of this change.

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:46.180
Our plans have simply changed a bit.

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:48.810
Just dispose of everything that can't be used anymore.

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:50.880
You're telling us to assist you?

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:55.320
Live and let live. I believe those were your own words.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:59.020
Very well. I suppose I wouldn't mind having you in my debt.

00:17:00.230 --> 00:17:02.190
This planet has outlived its usefulness!

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:03.830
All ships, maximum firepower!

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:06.060
Destroy that statue or whatever it is!

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:16.610
Fire!

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:22.370
Hey, look!

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:29.950
Look out, God!

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.870
Enemy signal lost!

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:51.780
Excellent. Obliterate the planet next.

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:52.880
The signal's back!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:53.810
What?!

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:00.820
Random jump!

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:03.290
B-but what about our allies' attacks...?!

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:05.560
I only did that to buy us some time!

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.390
I don't care if this ship is the only one that escapes!

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:11.520
Oh, no you don't!

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:16.200
Stay away!

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:17.790
Commencing jump!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.710
We've entered hyperspace!

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:28.950
Damn you...

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:30.920
Damn you, Seina Yamada!

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:32.920
I swear I'll kill you!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.780
You've taken everything from...

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:40.920
T-this can't be happening...

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:52.460
We're dreaming.

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:56.510
In almost all instances of encounters with life forms

00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:58.710
from higher planes of existence,

00:18:58.710 --> 00:19:02.880
we've witnessed phenomena that go against all of our laws of physics.

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:04.480
What are you talking about?

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:09.790
Unbelievable as it may be, they have the ability to overcome these laws.

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:12.890
So it would seem that not even our basic notions of physical laws

00:19:12.890 --> 00:19:15.460
apply to them.

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:16.560
Ridiculous.

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:20.200
This is no time for a military man to give a speech as if he were a scientist!

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:25.940
Then, as you just said, we must all be dreaming.

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:28.270
Flagship to all friendly vessels!

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:32.070
All ships are ordered to stop where they are and cease all attacks!

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:34.510
What the hell are you...

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:36.410
W-what are you doing...?!

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:39.040
Commander. You don't want to wind up like that, do you?

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:02.270
W-what the heck is that?!

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:06.980
You don't think it's Seina-chan, do you...?

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:08.980
Did someone call me?

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:10.550
Seina!

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:12.650
Are you all right, Seina-sama?!

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:15.090
That's great! Fuku's safe too!

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:19.060
Huh? Kiriko-san, Amane-san, Ryoko-san, and even Neige-chan...

00:20:19.060 --> 00:20:21.390
What's wrong? Why are you all together?

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:22.930
Don't give us that!

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:24.700
Taking off on your own like that...!

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:27.030
We were worried about you, of course!

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:29.360
You're such an idiot, Seina!

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:36.670
This is great! I'm alive and kickin' again!

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:41.580
Wiped out?! Even jokes have their limits!

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:43.450
What about Tarant Shank?

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:48.620
We don't know. But he means very little to us now anyway.

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:53.460
The real issue is whether or not the Devil Princess has caught on to us.

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:54.730
I seriously doubt she has.

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:58.030
The decision-making is restricted to high-level command only.

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:03.500
Not even the Devil Princess herself could intrude that far... Right?

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:05.870
This latest incident couldn't have been avoided.

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:09.210
There is more than one source for easy funds, after all.

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:11.110
Excuse me for interrupting.

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:12.640
Who is it?!

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:19.020
I have news regarding Seina Yamada's four escaped accomplices.

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:20.220
News?

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:22.550
I doubt it really matters, but enter.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:23.490
Yes, sir!

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:35.630
It would seem the game is up, wouldn't it?

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:42.470
Hold on, Seina! I just saw a bunch of Fukus!

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:45.340
I'm not hearing things, I'm seeing things! Right, Seina-sama?

00:21:45.340 --> 00:21:47.880
Yay! Tons of Fukus!

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:49.880
Where did you get them all, Seina-chan?!

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:52.550
The GP can't take care of that many!

00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:56.280
You certainly know how to cause a commotion...

00:21:57.360 --> 00:22:00.590
Even so, that's...

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:27.020
You're the worst, most hopeless,
most unlucky boy in all of space...

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:34.890
Even against your will...
(You fail.)

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:36.700
Even when you're gentle...
(You're extremely clumsy.)

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:41.200
With too much fighting spirit,
in vain, it's all coming to nothing...

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:44.190
You're gonna fail.

00:22:45.370 --> 00:22:48.040
Carefully...
(So irritating!)

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:50.040
Or with violence...
(Ow! Quit it!)

00:22:50.040 --> 00:23:01.110
You're the worst and most hopeless...
you're a lost cause.

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:10.830
You're the worst and the most hopeless...


00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:15.170
You're an unlucky boy...

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:20.510
But, any way, I'm with you.

00:23:20.510 --> 00:23:25.670
So, more and more,
keep on doing what you do!

00:23:31.380 --> 00:23:33.050
My hands-on training as a decoy has ended,

00:23:33.050 --> 00:23:35.680
and now I have to move from Amane-san's house back to the dorms.

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:38.560
Now I get to have regular classes for a while.

00:23:38.560 --> 00:23:42.060
